        "explanation": "Gọi giao điểm của đường thẳng d<sub>3</sub>với hai đường thẳng d<sub>1</sub>,d<sub>2</sub>lần lượt là M,N.<br>Ta có: M (1−t;−1 + 2t;−3t), N(−u;1 + 2u; −1 + u)<br>⇒ <span class=\"m-vec\">AM</span> = (−t,2t + 1,−3t −1),<span class=\"m-vec\">AN</span> = (−u −1,2u + 3,u − 2).<br>Có A,M,N thẳng hàng nên ⇒ <span class=\"m-sys\"><span class=\"m-sys-brace\">{</span><span class=\"m-sys-rows\"><span class=\"m-sys-row\">−t = k(−u −1)</span><span class=\"m-sys-row\">2t + 1 = k(2u + 3)</span><span class=\"m-sys-row\">−3t −1 = k(u − 2)</span></span></span> ⇔ <span class=\"m-sys\"><span class=\"m-sys-brace\">{</span><span class=\"m-sys-rows\"><span class=\"m-sys-row\">−t + ku + k = 0</span><span class=\"m-sys-row\">2t − 2ku −3k = −1</span><span class=\"m-sys-row\">−3t − ku + 2k = 1</span></span></span> ⇔ <span class=\"m-sys\"><span class=\"m-sys-brace\">{</span><span class=\"m-sys-rows\"><span class=\"m-sys-row\">t = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"m-sys-row\">k = 1</span><span class=\"m-sys-row\">ku = −<span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">2</span></span></span></span></span><br>⇒ <span class=\"m-vec\">AM</span> = (−<span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">2</span></span>,2,<span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">−5</span><span class=\"den\">2</span></span>) = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">2</span></span>(−1;4;−5).<br>Phương trình đường thẳng d<sub>3</sub>đi qua A có vectơ chỉ phương <span class=\"m-vec\">u</span><sub>3</sub> = (−1;4;−5) là:<br><span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">x −1</span><span class=\"den\">−1</span></span> = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">y + 2</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span> = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">z −1</span><span class=\"den\">−5</span></span>.<br>Nhận thấy điểm M (2;−6;6) ∈ d<sub>3</sub>do đó phướng trình d<sub>3</sub>được viết lại thành:<br><span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">x − 2</span><span class=\"den\">−1</span></span> = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">y + 6</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span> = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">z −6</span><span class=\"den\">−5</span></span>."
