">{</span><span class=\"m-sys-rows\"><span class=\"m-sys-row\">t′ = 1</span><span class=\"m-sys-row\">t = −1</span></span></span><br>.<span class=\"m-vec\">u</span><sub>2</sub> = 0<br>⇒ M (2;2;4),N (3;−1;2),<span class=\"m-vec\">MN</span> = (1;− 3;− 2).<br>Vậy phương trình Δ:<span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">x − 2</span><span class=\"den\">1</span></span> = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">y − 2</span><span class=\"den\">−3</span></span> = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">z − 4</span><span class=\"den\">−2</span></span>."
