        "explanation": "Ta có: SA = (−2; − 2; 0) ⇒ SA = 2<span class=\"m-root\">√<span class=\"m-rad\">2</span></span>; SC = (2; −6; 2) ⇒ SC = 2<span class=\"m-root\">√<span class=\"m-rad\">11</span></span><br>Khi đó: <span class=\"m-vec\">AC</span> = (4; − 4; 2) ⇒ AC = 6 ⇒ ΔSAC vuông tại A<br>Ta có: <span class=\"m-sys\"><span class=\"m-sys-brace\">{</span><span class=\"m-sys-rows\"><span class=\"m-sys-row\">(ABC) ⊥ (SAC)</span><span class=\"m-sys-row\">(ABC) ∩ (SAC) = AC</span><span class=\"m-sys-row\">SA ⊥ AC</span></span></span> ⇒ SA ⊥ (ABC)<br>,SA ⊂ (SAC)<br>Gọi (S) là mặt cầu tâm I (1; − 2; −1) và tiếp xúc với mặt phẳng (SBC) ⇒ R = d(I,(SBC))<br>Ta có: IA ∩ (SBC) = C ⇒ <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">d(I,(SBC))</span><span class=\"den\">d(A,(SBC))</span></span> = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">IC</span><span class=\"den\">AC</span></span> = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">2</span></span> ⇒ d(I,(SBC)) = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">2</span></span>d(A,(SBC))<br>Ta chứng minh được BC ⊥ (SAB)<br>Gọi H là hình chiếu của A trên SB ⇒ AH ⊥ (SBC) ⇒ d(A,(SBC)) = AH<br>Ta có: AB = <span class=\"m-root\">√<span class=\"m-rad\">AC<sup>2</sup>− BC<sup>2</sup></span></span> = 3 ⇒ AH = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">AS.AB</span><span class=\"den\"><span class=\"m-root\">√<span class=\"m-rad\">AS<sup>2</sup> + AB<sup>2</sup></span></span></span></span> = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">6<span class=\"m-root\">√<span class=\"m-rad\">34</span></span></span><span class=\"den\">17</span></span> ⇒ R = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">3<span class=\"m-root\">√<span class=\"m-rad\">34</span></span></span><span class=\"den\">17</span></span><br>Phương trình mặt cầu (S):(x −1)<sup>2</sup> + (y + 2)<sup>2</sup> + (z + 1)<sup>2</sup> = <span class=\"m-frac\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"den\">17</span></span>."
